    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Months, seasons and dates",
     "texto": [
      "Unlike in English, months are written in **lowercase** and take **en**: **en juillet** (in July).",
      "The seasons: **en été** (in summer), **en automne**, **en hiver** (in winter), but **au printemps** (in spring).",
      "Dates use **le** and the normal number, with no «de»: **le 3 décembre** (December 3rd). Only the 1st is different: **le premier mai**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
